the King, and 14 princes, any civilians will
be picked by lottery and those odds are only

00:14:35.529 --> 00:14:39.310
1 in 1300.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:45.620
In a recording studio, more reporters discuss
the bestiary known to mankind (which is that

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:49.000
book all the hunters have that rank certain
threats).

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:54.380
A female reporter asks someone to explain
to them in terms they would understand, how

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:56.860
dangerous is the C class ranking.

00:14:56.860 --> 00:15:01.610
The man states that its things, like bears,
sharks, poisonous snakes etc, stuff you might

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:05.600
come across if your unlucky that might turn
fatal in the worst case senario.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:10.300
Another anchor states that opinions online
declare that the Dark Continent surely must

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.430
harbor Rank B or A creatures.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:17.290
Laughing in response, the random man says
well ofcourse no body can count them out completely,

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:20.990
but these people also assume that mankind
has never even ventured there in the past

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:22.750
because dangerous creatures exist.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:28.970
OML the ammount of information Togashi is
shoving down my throat rn, Anyways Continuing

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:32.550
Many ancient ruins describe the calamities
caused by going to the continent.

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:36.980
Science has concluded that these mass casualties
were from infections and viruses, now with

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:41.190
modern medicine they will easily be able to
prevent such problems from occuring.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:45.680
On top of that the stuff they do find is much
more likely to be hiding miraculous compounds

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:49.050
that can help mankind advance further than
it ever has before.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.930
As the broadcast comes to an end, that dude
declares that this will be the greatest goldrush

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.130
in all of human history.

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:59.779
Having rolled up as the broadcast was finishing
on the TV Ging Freecss the big man himself

00:15:59.779 --> 00:16:03.899
arrives in the lair of Beyond's Dark Continent
Expedition Team, and confronts Pariston Hill.

00:16:03.899 --> 00:16:07.690
Ging explains that if the government doesn't
answer to Beyond's taunt and send them to

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:13.519
the Dark Continent, Pariston in response would
force there hand and send in 5,000 Chimera.

00:16:13.519 --> 00:16:18.220
He continues telling him that he will no longer
allow Pariston to do as he pleases and tells

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:22.509
him that he’s now going to play with him
personally until he begs him to stop.

00:16:22.509 --> 00:16:27.459
Pariston looks at Ging with his deep dark
eyes he responds confidently asking if he’s

00:16:27.459 --> 00:16:29.709
finally going to pay him some attention.

00:16:29.709 --> 00:16:34.480
Ging who’s visibly disgusted with Pariston
just answers that he might just be doing it

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:37.750
for his own fun…

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:43.290
Cheadle contacts one of the OG OG’s Leorio
over the phone, and invites him to become

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:44.899
a member of the Zodiacs.

00:16:44.899 --> 00:16:49.170
She explains that the association thinks that
his skills are best suited to fill the position

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.980
and they absolutely need his help the upcoming
mission.

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:56.200
When Leorio implies that he will turn down
the offer, Cheadle continues to say that there

00:16:56.200 --> 00:17:00.940
is a medical study waiting for him and that
she will be the head medical professor herself.

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:05.910
Hearing this, Leorio who in most cases wouldve
rejected the offer ends up accepting as he

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:09.350
knows that theres no chance this will ever
happen again in his life.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:14.860
He thanks her for granting him this opportunity,
however he has just one request, he asks Cheadle

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:19.289
if there is still another position available
in the Zodiacs because if there is he has

00:17:19.289 --> 00:17:21.070
someone he’s like to recommended for the
post.

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:24.760
AND WE KNOW WHO THAT EYE COVERTING CHAIN WEILDING
KING IS!!

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:28.799
In the lair of Beyond’s Dark Continent Expedition
Team, which btw has literally the scary girl

00:17:28.799 --> 00:17:33.220
maze game picture now featured on the TV,
Not sure why Togashi decided to chuck this

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:37.840
in here, BUT HOLY it plays to the feeling
of the meeting having this scary ass pic of

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.740
a child featured on the television.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:44.020
There Pariston states that the Hunter Exam
will begin soon, and that he knows Ging is

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:49.179
aware of the 5000 Chimera Ants he has hidden
away as a back up to force V5 into into the

00:17:49.179 --> 00:17:50.179
expedition.

00:17:50.179 --> 00:17:53.470
He thinks Cheadle will separate the Hunter
Exam from the organization, which Pariston

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:54.559
disapproves of.

00:17:54.559 --> 00:17:59.000
When Ging asks him why he would want to destroy
the Hunter Association despite feeling attached

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:03.230
to it, Pariston asks him to prove it, starting
from his motives.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:07.250
Ging starts to explain that Pariston is seeking
something new that could entertain him as

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:10.750
the association has started to tire him, because
of this Ging assumes that Pariston thought

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:13.850
it was time to move on and find new targets.

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:18.100
The fastest way is by scattering the Chimera
Ants across the world, while also opening

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:21.030
the previously illegal routes to the Dark
Continent.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:26.309
He continues to say that Pariston's underlings
might easily pass the Exam, and become organizational

00:18:26.309 --> 00:18:27.309
members.

00:18:27.309 --> 00:18:30.580
However, he cannot see the link between why
pariston would brandish the treat of the Chimera

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.690
Ants against the association.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:37.460
He concludes by proclaiming that Pariston
and he are kindred spirits and there ideas

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:40.870
are always a tiny bit off the beaten track.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:44.860
Pariston's smile weakens as he concedes that
Ging is spot-on.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:49.549
He reflects that normally people find happiness
in loving and being loved, but he feels happy

00:18:49.549 --> 00:18:54.320
most when he is hated and he continually feels
this irrepressible need to destroy the things

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.740
he loves.

00:18:55.740 --> 00:19:01.200
Malevontly he wonders aloud if it is all that
weird, with Ging replying that Pariston is

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.850
completely off the mark and asserting they
are different in that respect.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:09.160
Curly quietly tries to ask a question, but
is completely shunned by Ging, much to his

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.160
dismay.

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:14.700
Usamen this Hajimo looking wannabe stands
up and threatens the former Boar zodiac, but

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:19.100
before he can do anything, he is lifted up
by Ging and imagines his own face being caved

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.960
in by the latter's plethora punches.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:26.170
Coming back to reality, the dude realised
he probably just witnessed his own death as

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:31.559
Ging then orders him to get lost if he understands,
then quickly looking around the room he finds

00:19:31.559 --> 00:19:35.370
a "robotic girl" in the corner and asks if
she is the highest-ranked person.

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:39.890
Pariston interrupts his intruding though and
calls himself the obvious number two within

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:41.920
the team.

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:47.960
Ging observes with surprise that people are
not ranked by strength, releasing Usamen.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:52.110
Pariston objects he is being underestimated
but Ging coldly states he would end up killing

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:56.830
him if they were to fight, however he would
continue to display his disgusting smile and

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:59.720
laugh unless his very spirit was defeated.

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.940
He then declares himself number two and challenges
anyone that opposes him.

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:08.220
Mizaistom the big COW of the Zodiacs heads
out in search of Kurapika.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:11.750
(as that was obviously the person Leorio recommended
for the position.)

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:15.559
Once arriving at Kuripikas place, Linssen
informs him that he’s currently out but

00:20:15.559 --> 00:20:17.570
can leave a message for him if he’d like.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:22.390
Mizaistom insists to wait mans literally like
can I have a coffee and DW ill manage with

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:27.380
the milk which is insane hahaha anyways, but
three men block his pathway.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:32.059
Calmly though the COW KING pulls out and shows
them a warning card, which indicates that

00:20:32.059 --> 00:20:34.080
acts of violence are not allowed.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:38.470
When the men move to attack him, Mizaistom
uses the card to restrain the men's movements,

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:41.929
most likely apart of his Nen ability called
Cross Game.

00:20:41.929 --> 00:20:45.429
Sitting down in the corner of the room, he
tells the men they’ll all be able to move

00:20:45.429 --> 00:20:49.970
in a moment, but warns them that if they try
and resist more itl continue to imobilize

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:50.970
them.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:55.501
Finally, the bartender interupts, telling
him that Kurapika is in the basement, he warns

00:20:55.501 --> 00:20:59.880
the cow to not anger him as Kurapika is really
upset about something that concerns their

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:00.880
group.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:04.700
Before he can finish explaining though, Kurapika
himself appears asking what all the noise

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:08.520
is and how the random man wearing a cow uniform
in his house is.

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:13.360
Mizaistom introduces himself from the Hunter
Association and asks Kurapika about the news

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:15.419
