00:21:15.419 --> 00:21:20.750
He invites him to join the Zodiacs under the
request of Leorio, but Kurapika quickly declines,

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.320
telling him that he is busy.

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:27.280
Mizaistom suddenly brings up the prolific
Scarlet Eyes, which incites anger in Kurapika,

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:31.900
setting his own scarlet eyes alight with the
fire of all of his fallen clan members.

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:36.480
He makes his chains appear and threatens Mizaistom,
telling him to carefully choose his words

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.850
from now on.

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:41.770
Mizaistom reports that on the web there is
an illegal website in which criminals will

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:43.240
sell rare items through.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:47.470
6 Months ago, someone posted a video in which
a number of scarlet eyes are visible.

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:51.900
Having seen this video himself, Kurapika already
knows about the content within it.

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:57.250
However the COW KING then reveals that they
managed to find the owner of those eyes, something

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.240
