unable to do.

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:04.030
He tells him that, they would all like him
to join the Zodiacs and take part in the expedition

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:05.059
to the new world.

00:22:05.059 --> 00:22:09.429
An expedition that will last approximately
2 months, he asks him to carefully study the

00:22:09.429 --> 00:22:12.770
ins and out of the proposal before coming
to a decision.

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:17.190
Kurapika considers the offer thourougly thinking
about how its a priority of his to recover

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:22.039
the stolen eyes, because of this he joins
on the spot so he can find out the true identity

00:22:22.039 --> 00:22:24.580
of the person who owns these eyes.

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:29.380
After a moment, Mizaistom pulls out a picture
and gives it to Kurapika, its explained that

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:37.970
this man, the fourth Prince of the Kakin Empire,
Tserriednich Hui Guo Rou is the confirmed

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:42.179
owner of the stolen scarlet eyes.

00:22:42.179 --> 00:22:46.830
Kurapika recalls how he acquired the previous
sets of Scarlet Eyes that are now in his possession

00:22:46.830 --> 00:22:50.810
going over all of the people he’s had to
take down in his head, finally ending on the

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:54.770
man who is his current target, the son of
a king.

00:22:54.770 --> 00:23:00.890
Remembering Pairo, Kurapika realizes that
his joirney is finally beginning, he wonders

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:06.059
where he may go, a place where he’s greated
or one in which can call home…

00:23:06.059 --> 00:23:11.280
However he sadly remembers that he no longers
has anything like that at all in his life…

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:14.520
Back in the lair of Beyond's Dark Continent
Expedition Team, the members are still doubtful

00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:17.390
