00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:36.740
He asks if they have anyquestions and not
to hesitate as he’ll answer with pleasure.

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:41.679
Another member who seemed skeptical over whether
or not he’ll get paid asks if he’s sure

00:23:41.679 --> 00:23:45.529
he doesnt have any other requests to make
of the group, to which ging again tells them

00:23:45.529 --> 00:23:47.539
NO and to trust them..

00:23:47.539 --> 00:23:51.470
Ging says that if they allow him to be the
No.2 theyll all be paid accordingly and the

00:23:51.470 --> 00:23:53.090
case will be closed.

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:57.870
That skeptical member gives Ging his account
number, and only a few moments later after

00:23:57.870 --> 00:24:01.529
visibly being suprised at the money in his
account, leaves the lair with the other mombers

00:24:01.529 --> 00:24:03.710
noting that he probably wont come back.

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:08.580
Ging asks Pariston if he has objections, in
which Pariston actually says he’s happy

00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:09.980
