00:38:56.930 --> 00:39:01.440
Ging tells him to shut up aswell as Pariston
actually provoked them in the first place.

00:39:01.440 --> 00:39:05.290
Hearing this the sly ray cheekily jokes that
he was just going along with what Ging had

00:39:05.290 --> 00:39:06.290
said.

00:39:06.290 --> 00:39:09.430
After gaining a bit of distance between the
two, Pariston asks if they should fight back,

00:39:09.430 --> 00:39:12.380
to which Ging agrees, but wants to do it "gently".

00:39:12.380 --> 00:39:17.370
He analyzes their abilities noting that their
emitters who have to conjure guns to fight.

00:39:17.370 --> 00:39:23.510
Seeing him preparing to attack, Pariston asks
if it is okay for him to watch use his ability,

00:39:23.510 --> 00:39:26.880
but cause Gings literally a Chad and not a
dad he responds affirmatively saying that

00:39:26.880 --> 00:39:28.120
it aint no problem.

00:39:28.120 --> 00:39:32.390
Watching with a gaze of amazement, Pariston
witnesses Ging reproduces Leorio's "remote

00:39:32.390 --> 00:39:37.140
