00:39:52.950 --> 00:39:53.950
by it.

00:39:53.950 --> 00:39:58.370
Continuing on his brutal shows of dominance,
Ging surmises on how leorio must've been palpating

00:39:58.370 --> 00:40:01.720
his patients and using his aura like an ultra
sound.

00:40:01.720 --> 00:40:05.790
Through this he assumes that his Nen ability
was the result of experimentation with aura

00:40:05.790 --> 00:40:06.790
and tapping.

00:40:06.790 --> 00:40:11.200
Then literally flexing on pariston some more
he again uses the same ultra sound like technique

00:40:11.200 --> 00:40:14.440
to discover two enemies on the other side
of a wall.

00:40:14.440 --> 00:40:18.619
Imagining those said enemies have a tumor
or a blood clot that can't be reached with

00:40:18.619 --> 00:40:23.069
normal medical equipment, he shoots two aura
bullets through the wall completely taking

00:40:23.069 --> 00:40:25.380
down the unsuspecting henchmen.

00:40:25.380 --> 00:40:29.490
After using that Same ability again, he confirms
that there are no more enemies coming after

00:40:29.490 --> 00:40:30.490
them.

00:40:30.490 --> 00:40:34.330
Pariston speculates it is because they have
given up, but Ging disagrees, stating they

00:40:34.330 --> 00:40:36.730
must assume the mission was completed.

00:40:36.730 --> 00:40:41.570
He reveals he has known all along the whole
thing was actually staged by Pariston, and

00:40:41.570 --> 00:40:45.470
the biggest mistake in his attempt to fool
Ging was that the angry guy with the Mohawk

00:40:45.470 --> 00:40:50.230
didnt bring up the faith possible choice of
both Ging and Pariston leaving; although he

00:40:50.230 --> 00:40:52.410
admits that he might have gone with it if
