00:41:44.550 --> 00:41:49.089
Ging recognizes him as a symbiotic type Nen
user which Muherr confirms before explaining

00:41:49.089 --> 00:41:53.400
that Golem himself conjures a powerful, heavy
weapon that is manned by an Emitter who creates

00:41:53.400 --> 00:41:58.099
