00:42:04.349 --> 00:42:09.369
Muherr continues explaining, for mid to long-term
group warfare, carrying real guns loaded with

00:42:09.369 --> 00:42:12.920
Nen bullets greatly increases the efficiency
on the battlefield.

00:42:12.920 --> 00:42:17.410
Golem and the other 10 men with assault and
recon duties make up the "Stone Wall" squad,

00:42:17.410 --> 00:42:21.490
the legendary unit which came out of the Lubo
civil war without a single casualty.

00:42:21.490 --> 00:42:25.680
Ging is impressed by Golem's abilities and
asks it its real name, but a distorted voice

00:42:25.680 --> 00:42:30.970
replies that "Golem" is how it is called by
its comrades and declares that further enquires

00:42:30.970 --> 00:42:32.700
will not be answered.

00:42:32.700 --> 00:42:36.540
Confused and curious, Muherr informs Ging
that he has known Golem for over three years,

00:42:36.540 --> 00:42:39.270
and still does not know anything about who
pilots it.

00:42:39.270 --> 00:42:44.390
Ging admits that he was expecting it, as Golem
has been giving off that "don't talk to me"

00:42:44.390 --> 00:42:45.390
vibe.

00:42:45.390 --> 00:42:48.740
Getting down to business now, Ging asks Muherr
to convince the other members of Beyond's

00:42:48.740 --> 00:42:52.440
group to take his money since he’s in charge
of all the divisions.

00:42:52.440 --> 00:42:56.589
The mercenary responds that he was fine with
having the Hunter as number 2 until he offered

00:42:56.589 --> 00:42:57.599
to give them money.

00:42:57.599 --> 00:43:02.250
Him along with all his mem think soldiers
value each other's trust more than anything,

00:43:02.250 --> 00:43:05.170
the rumor that some of them could be bought
would lead to them being ostracized.

00:43:05.170 --> 00:43:10.160
The fact that Ging was tossing his money around
as if it had no consequence was a cause of

00:43:10.160 --> 00:43:14.329
great anger to him as, like the title of a
book or the place where the remote is put

00:43:14.329 --> 00:43:19.490
on the table, something had already been decided
in merit, and trying to change it so carelessly

00:43:19.490 --> 00:43:23.810
only had negative repercussions, to the point
many members even considered quitting.

00:43:23.810 --> 00:43:27.520
Muherr then demands that Ging explains himself,
but the Hunter can't.

00:43:27.520 --> 00:43:31.270
He can only say he is sorry and, since he
can't take back the money from those who have

00:43:31.270 --> 00:43:35.160
accepted it as that would just add to this
mess, suggests to settle the matter with donations

00:43:35.160 --> 00:43:38.569
to the Norwell Fund, for the families of fallen
soldiers.

00:43:38.569 --> 00:43:44.770
Which is this whole trust fund type foundation
that supports the families of fallen mercenaries.

00:43:44.770 --> 00:43:47.540
So obviously this hits home for muherr.

00:43:47.540 --> 00:43:52.109
Taken by surprise, Muherr asks him if he is
serious, as by opening a grandchild account,

00:43:52.109 --> 00:43:55.270
he won't be able to refuse requests by the
grandfather account.

00:43:55.270 --> 00:43:59.410
Ging replies that it's for the best, as it
shows his determination and won't risk stirring

00:43:59.410 --> 00:44:01.360
up any weird rumors.

00:44:01.360 --> 00:44:06.309
Muherr inquires why he is so keen on giving
them his money, and Ging admits that he doesn't

00:44:06.309 --> 00:44:07.309
know.

00:44:07.309 --> 00:44:10.590
He often ends up in the kind of situation
where he talks a lot and then wonders why

00:44:10.590 --> 00:44:14.940
he's done it, but probably the main reason
was that he knew the expedition members aren't

00:44:14.940 --> 00:44:18.730
the kind of people who would be bought by
money, so he thought that if they were to

00:44:18.730 --> 00:44:21.080
take it, it would mean they have accepted
him.

00:44:21.080 --> 00:44:25.300
Perhaps it was also because he was happy there
were other fools like him around.

00:44:25.300 --> 00:44:29.290
He confesses he had planned to go to the Dark
Continent on his own, but the fuss caused

00:44:29.290 --> 00:44:35.170
by Beyond's own expedition had made it impossible,
so he was very angry, but at the same time

00:44:35.170 --> 00:44:38.360
aware that Beyond had been preparing for even
longer than he has.

00:44:38.360 --> 00:44:42.579
When he came to his base, he had not straightened
out his feelings yet, and only wanted to blow

00:44:42.579 --> 00:44:43.579
off some steam.

00:44:43.579 --> 00:44:46.230
He does not even remember how the whole money
topic originated.

00:44:46.230 --> 00:44:51.850
Mascher though, remember that thumb looking
dude, well he jumps in to give his take on

00:44:51.850 --> 00:44:52.910
what happened.

00:44:52.910 --> 00:44:56.790
Mascher explains asked Ging himself, while
he was arguing with Pariston.

00:44:56.790 --> 00:45:00.690
Initially, Mascher believed he was just a
troublemaker with a provocative facade and

00:45:00.690 --> 00:45:04.990
the tendency to try to manipulate others,
but during the discussion, he heard the two

00:45:04.990 --> 00:45:10.110
former Zodiacs speaking about Isaac Netero,
Ging's feelings toward the Dark Continent.

00:45:10.110 --> 00:45:14.430
Mascher and Marione were ready to fight in
the event disorder rose, but since they prioritized

00:45:14.430 --> 00:45:19.170
solving the problem, they recognized that
Ging's lead had undeniable merits.

00:45:19.170 --> 00:45:26.770
Muherr still doesn't exactly understand how
this is related to the money, Ging though

00:45:26.770 --> 00:45:30.230
admits he was just trying to be cool about
it, at the time he didnt foresee that it would

00:45:30.230 --> 00:45:31.490
cause such an uproar.

00:45:31.490 --> 00:45:36.070
Although his relationship with Pariston is
complicated, he is not concocting anything:

00:45:36.070 --> 00:45:40.000
he just wants to thwart Pariston's schemes
and help Beyond be free.

00:45:40.000 --> 00:45:44.170
Golem joins the conversation, asking Muherr
why he had not told them sooner.

00:45:44.170 --> 00:45:48.510
The mercenary awkwardly responds that, in
order to quell the disorder, he had to get

00:45:48.510 --> 00:45:49.820
Ging to acknowledge his shame.

00:45:49.820 --> 00:45:55.430
He urges Golem to try and understand his feelings,
yet, to no avail causing Ging to feel like

00:45:55.430 --> 00:45:56.829
that too is his fault.

00:45:56.829 --> 00:46:01.869
In the end, Muherr accepts and says he'll
talk to the soldiers, provided the money goes

00:46:01.869 --> 00:46:03.609
to the Nowell Foundation.

00:46:03.609 --> 00:46:07.800
Plus, despite Ging being the number 2 in the
operation, it will be the mercenaries that

00:46:07.800 --> 00:46:11.980
will give the orders to everyone on the battlefield
and those orders are absolute.

00:46:11.980 --> 00:46:14.540
Ging agrees and salutes, while comically answering
"Sir!

00:46:14.540 --> 00:46:15.540
Yes Sir!"

00:46:15.540 --> 00:46:20.900
Which helps reminds me of Gon, honestly dude
is just a grown up Gon on that world smoke.

00:46:20.900 --> 00:46:22.840
Anyways with the matter finally settled.

00:46:22.840 --> 00:46:27.369
Muherr asks Pariston if the ones who are returning
to the base will accept Ging, and quickly

00:46:27.369 --> 00:46:29.190
receives an affirmative answer.

00:46:29.190 --> 00:46:33.590
Pariston tells Ging that, since the infiltration
failed, he may now send his money to the list

00:46:33.590 --> 00:46:38.109
of contacts he is transmitting him and congratulates
him for getting the cemented position amount

00:46:38.109 --> 00:46:39.109
the group.

00:46:39.109 --> 00:46:43.590
However as we know Ging is a multiverse level
theorist and states that his authority is

00:46:43.590 --> 00:46:49.410
only in name as everyone will continue to
do what he says, either way, he is willing

00:46:49.410 --> 00:46:54.440
to let Pariston lead, as he wants to watch,
but the latter declines, wanting to see how

00:46:54.440 --> 00:46:56.350
he indeed handles things.

00:46:56.350 --> 00:46:59.670
Ging smirks back and declares that he will
not hold back.

00:46:59.670 --> 00:47:05.190
BTW just gonna cut myself off here, since
the next arc after this one may never be completed

00:47:05.190 --> 00:47:09.691
depending on how frequently Togashi releases
chapters, hopefully these next 33 that are

00:47:09.691 --> 00:47:15.970
confirmed will complete it ,but if not, be
sure to let me know what fights throughout

00:47:15.970 --> 00:47:19.880
the succession arc you want me to cover and
honestly push this video to like 5k likes

00:47:19.880 --> 00:47:23.370
and ill break that arc down into parts so
I can cover at least some of it.

00:47:23.370 --> 00:47:28.140
Annnyways back over with Big C At the final
part of the 289th Hunter Exam.

00:47:28.140 --> 00:47:31.931
There she asks the applicants whether they
knew about Beyond's expedition to the Dark

00:47:31.931 --> 00:47:36.480
Continent, and if they knew, how and when
did they get access to that information.

00:47:36.480 --> 00:47:39.700
The participants were also asked how they
would explain their information in the best

00:47:39.700 --> 00:47:44.450
way to a person that did not know about this
and on what the merits of receiving this information

00:47:44.450 --> 00:47:45.470
beforehand were.

00:47:45.470 --> 00:47:50.600
In another room, Kurapika and Mizaistom are
trying to verify what the applicants say.

00:47:50.600 --> 00:47:55.380
He concludes that the first examinee doesn't
know, the second Muherr has mixed truth in

00:47:55.380 --> 00:48:00.319
with lies, and that the third one is hiding
extremely important information.

00:48:00.319 --> 00:48:03.780
Kurapika is surprised at the number of people
that have cleared the thermography and lie

00:48:03.780 --> 00:48:04.780
detectors.

00:48:04.780 --> 00:48:09.160
He then explains his abilities to Mizaistom,
and the limitations it has.

00:48:09.160 --> 00:48:12.630
Obviously I'm not gonna bore you all with
repeating stuff that was explained ages ago

00:48:12.630 --> 00:48:13.740
in the anime.

00:48:13.740 --> 00:48:17.960
So after that he thinks about the possibility
that if the enemy has someone on their side

00:48:17.960 --> 00:48:22.390
that can manipulate another's memory, then
his chain would likely not work as that person

00:48:22.390 --> 00:48:25.290
wouldn't even realize they were lying to begin
with.

00:48:25.290 --> 00:48:27.530
Skipping away over to Prince T with the crazy
name.

00:48:27.530 --> 00:48:32.420
Well he gets a call from his elder brother
Benjamin who's this jacked ass dude and mans

00:48:32.420 --> 00:48:35.000
also wrestling with a damn lio.

00:48:35.000 --> 00:48:38.960
Benjamin informs him that their father has
decided that whoever survives this expedition

00:48:38.960 --> 00:48:40.710
becomes the new king.

00:48:40.710 --> 00:48:45.490
Thankful of God, Tserriednich warns his brother
that he is the one who is going to be the

00:48:45.490 --> 00:48:46.490
king.

00:48:46.490 --> 00:48:50.250
After the call ends, Tserriednich then gets
another one fom one of his bodyguards called

00:48:50.250 --> 00:48:56.820
Theta, she informs him that all five of his
staff have passed the hunter exam.

00:48:56.820 --> 00:49:01.040
She explained that if they lied or hid any
information from the Hunter Association, they

00:49:01.040 --> 00:49:02.240
wouldve been rejected.

00:49:02.240 --> 00:49:07.410
She then confirms that the bodyguards of the
princes that haven't participated in the exam

00:49:07.410 --> 00:49:12.010
were Benjamin's and Tyson's or the first and
sixth princes respectively.

00:49:12.010 --> 00:49:16.950
On top of that all of the bodyguards from
the seventh prince, Luzurus, failed the exams,

00:49:16.950 --> 00:49:21.230
having heard everything Tserriednich orders
Theta to return to her defensive duties and

00:49:21.230 --> 00:49:24.290
to tell everyone to get an understanding of
the Black Whale.

00:49:24.290 --> 00:49:28.920
Back at the Hunter Exam, Mizaistom confirms
that there is no one within the Zodiacs that

00:49:28.920 --> 00:49:31.369
has powers to manipulate somebody's memory.

00:49:31.369 --> 00:49:36.700
He continues to say that within the Zodiacs,
there were three factions, with Ging and Pariston

00:49:36.700 --> 00:49:37.700
being exceptions.

00:49:37.700 --> 00:49:41.780
He knows all of the powers of the Hunters
of his own faction (which includes Botobai,

00:49:41.780 --> 00:49:46.430
Cheadle, and Ginta) but doesn't know the powers
of the other members.

00:49:46.430 --> 00:49:50.380
The duo are obviously suspicious of Juhnde
and Muherr, and wonder if they were purposely

00:49:50.380 --> 00:49:53.900
sent in as decoys by some powerful spies.

00:49:53.900 --> 00:49:58.411
Mizai infers that the spy may be a traitor
within the Zodiacs, since Pariston left so

00:49:58.411 --> 00:50:01.320
soon after losing the presidential election.

00:50:01.320 --> 00:50:05.910
Hearing this Kurapika volunteers to find the
traitor using his chain ability and will wait

00:50:05.910 --> 00:50:08.069
in a nearby room while he confronts them.

00:50:08.069 --> 00:50:11.920
Suddenly re-entering the room Mizaistom abruptly
confronts the Zodiacs about there being a

00:50:11.920 --> 00:50:14.000
possible spy within the group.

00:50:14.000 --> 00:50:18.420
He asks everyone to once again reveal their
abilities, but before he can proceed any further

00:50:18.420 --> 00:50:20.869
Kanzai starts raging out.

00:50:20.869 --> 00:50:26.010
Not fazed though the cow zodiac Explains that
he would've actually helped Beyond if he had

00:50:26.010 --> 00:50:29.839
met him before, he would've gladly tried to
help make his dream come true and wouldn't

00:50:29.839 --> 00:50:33.150
have changed his mind after seeing the chairman's
final video.

00:50:33.150 --> 00:50:37.430
However its a question of sequence, not betrayal
and that's why he’s asking him to reveal

00:50:37.430 --> 00:50:39.339
their abilities…

00:50:39.339 --> 00:50:43.430
continuing Mizai reveals his abilities to
them all and explains how it works exactly.

00:50:43.430 --> 00:50:48.380
Elsewhere the megabrain Kurapika watches the
whole thing on a monitor in a separate room

00:50:48.380 --> 00:50:49.540
via a hidden camera.

00:50:49.540 --> 00:50:54.030
He uses his sneaky ability to quickly scan
the zodiacs, passing off the ones who aren't

00:50:54.030 --> 00:51:11.950
spies, however he eventually finds out that
the 

00:51:11.950 --> 00:51:23.640
traitor 

00:51:23.640 --> 00:51:41.510
is 
the monkey Saiyu.

